              "marker": "2.",
              "text": "Students who lack the basic nursing training are required to take foundation courses on a mandatory basis. The units of foundation courses to be taken by each student may vary depending on the previous disciplinary knowledge of the student concerned. Normally, students taking foundation courses will not be able to complete all requirements within the normative study period. Foundation courses include MEDF1011, 1012, 1041, 1042, NURS1151, 1162, 1163, 1164, 1242, 1403, 1603, 1701, 3127 and 3315.",
